Others have already posted answers to the rest of your questions, but this
one was not commented on.

Unicorn horns do nothing to uncurse your equipment.

What you're confused with is probably that people tend to bless their
unicorns. To do this, you need a potion of holy water, and dip the
uncursed horn in it.

A blessed unicorn horn is much more effective than a an uncursed one,
since the chance of it working when you (a)pply it is much greater, and
you often want to have it work in a hurry.

Applying a unicorn horn cures lots of things that might ail you, like
confusion, stunnedness, sickness, and loss of attributes. You want to make
it work immediately, reliably, not needing several turns in which it
doesn't work.

